id: CTB-SRC0033-privacy
source: SRC-0033
section: §2.7
kind: requirement
scope: ARC
title: Privacy and compliance stay governed requirements and a release gate
applied-in: STG-00.A-1
text: Privacy and compliance is not a constitutional invariant, by the owner's choice of 2026-10-31; it remains governed requirements (consent, retention, data ownership and jurisdiction, all by configuration) and release gate 19, so it still blocks release until it is evidenced.
